[length:04:18.00]
[00:02.00]I was iron in the fire
[00:05.91]Unshaped, unrefined
[00:09.82]You were mercy in the waiting
[00:13.72]Like a hand in mine
[00:17.63]I don't lead with all the answers
[00:21.54]I just follow where He goes
[00:25.45]Learning strength is in the breaking
[00:29.35]And the love that chose
[00:33.26]I was breath inside the silence
[00:37.17]You were steady in the storm
[00:41.08]Every fear I tried to carry
[00:44.98]You were pulling me toward
[00:48.89]I don't stand in perfect courage
[00:52.80]But I'm held in perfect grace
[00:56.71]And the God who wrote our story
[01:00.62]Is the one we chase
[01:04.52]Not two roads, not two names
[01:08.43]Not two hearts untamed
[01:12.34]We are called into the same flame
[01:16.25]We are intertwined
[01:20.15]Like the cross where love was proven
[01:24.06]Your heart in mine
[01:27.97]Where the broken things are woven
[01:31.88]Side by side
[01:35.78]Through the shadow and the light
[01:39.69]We are two made one
[01:43.60]By the Father, Spirit, Son
[01:47.51]I will lay my life around you
[01:51.42]Like a shelter in the rain
[01:55.32]I will build my trust upon you
[01:59.23]Even when I feel the pain
[02:03.14]Not a crown, but just a promise
[02:07.05]Not a silence, but a voice
[02:10.95]We are choosing every moment
[02:14.86]We are choosing this for life
[02:18.77]We are intertwined
[02:22.68]Like the cross where love was proven
[02:26.58]Your heart in mine
[02:30.49]Where the broken things are woven
[02:34.40]Side by side
[02:38.31]Through the shadow and the light
[02:42.22]We are two made one
[02:46.12]By the Father, Spirit, Son
[02:50.03]I will cover you in kindness
[02:53.94]I will meet you in the fight
[02:57.85]When you're weak
[03:01.75]When you're weary
[03:05.66]We will stand in holy light
[03:09.57]Every scar becomes a story
[03:13.48]Every trial turns to grace
[03:17.38]We are forged into a union
[03:21.29]Nothing time could ever break
[03:25.20]Final Chorus
[03:29.11]We are intertwined
[03:33.02]Like the cross where love was proven
[03:36.92]Your heart in mine
[03:40.83]Where the broken things are woven
[03:44.74]Side by side
[03:48.65]Through the fire and the refining
[03:52.55]We are two made one
[03:56.46]And forever un-dividing
[04:00.37]Still becoming...
[04:04.28]Still becoming one...
[04:08.18]Held together...
[04:12.09]By the Holy One...
